This application allows you to quickly obtain information about the location of your vehicle. Application only for Matrix LLC customers.
In the detailed view of information, you can see the main monitoring parameters (speed, address, location, sensors), the application allows you to generate reports, get statistics on driving quality, receive notifications about various events, build tracks. In addition, the application allows you to receive push notifications to your phone. Convenient navigation and an intuitive interface will help you find the necessary information on the desired monitoring object in a couple of clicks.
With the Matrix GPS app in real time, you can:
- to observe the movement and location of objects on the map;
- track any changes in speed, temperature, fuel level, etc .;
- remotely control objects (force to execute a command, stop in case of speeding, etc.);
- receive notifications about the activity of the object on any gadget;
- request reporting in any convenient format (tables, graphs) and much more.
